OL,5,G1600 Come Dine with Me
OL,6,     FBury. The week's third host is
OL,7,     Fteacher James Perkin. He plans to
OL,8,     Fcook all his favourite dishes,
OL,9,     Fincluding a Sri Lankan curry which
OL,10,     Fhe learnt to make on his
OL,11,     Fhoneymoon. (Ep3/5)
OL,12,G1630 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FBury. The penultimate host of the
OL,14,     Fweek is waiter and all-round
OL,15,     Fentertainer Ali McKernan. He's
OL,16,     Ffeeling confident he can win, but
OL,17,     Fhis guests are stumped by his dog
OL,18,     Fbiscuit appetiser. (Ep4/5)
